# Codoc package

This repository is the Codoc Python package (`codoc` CLI).

- Keep changes scoped to the requested work.
- Unknown work stays out of the tree. Add a module when implementing it, not as an empty placeholder.
- Do not put roadmap, ticket, milestone, or product-vision text into rules, comments, README, commit messages that narrate a plan, or other repo files.
- Put CLI command names and aliases only in `COMMANDS` in `src/codoc/cli/`.
- Keep package code under `src/codoc/{cli,commands,config,discover,engine,generate,llm,model}/`. Mirror that layout under `tests/`.

Agent guidance source of truth is `.cursor/rules/`. `AGENTS.md` is an index that points here.
